      139.15,
      274.63,
      451.21,
      303.86
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 195 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No.15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the principal enactment) and is consequential to theamendment made by clause 3.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
