  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      314.95,
      451.21,
      344.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends the principal enactment by inserting new section 195Ain that enactment, and the legal effect of the amendment is to make provision to holdpre-trial conferences at the High Court in order to conclude trials expeditiously.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
