    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      266.33,
      401.9,
      290.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.13,
      401.86,
      328.07
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure(Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      341.93,
      401.89,
      378.47
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 195 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201dprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.09,
      392.33,
      401.86,
      416.27
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the substitution for paragraph (c) thereof of thefollowing paragraph: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      430.13,
      401.89,
      466.67
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c) inform the accused and the aggrievedparty of the date of the pre-trial conference tobe held under section 195A;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.09,
      480.53,
      355.53,
      491.87
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of paragraph (ee) thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      505.73,
      401.89,
      554.87
    ],
    "text": "3. The principal enactment is hereby amended by theinsertion immediately after section 195 thereof, of thefollowing new section which shall have effect as section195A of that enactment: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      208.29,
      568.73,
      355.28,
      580.07
    ],
    "text": "\u201cA-1- PRE-TRIAL CONFERENCES",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      593.93,
      401.87,
      617.87
    ],
