    "text": "(a) ascertaining whether the prosecutionhas handed over to the accused, allmaterial, the accused is legally entitledto receive, and for the purpose ofmaking appropriate orders, by Court inthat regard;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      228.57,
      366.89,
      401.89,
      413.27
    ],
    "text": "(b) ascertaining whether the accusedintends to plead guilty to any one ormore of the charges in the indictment,or to a lesser offence;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      229.29,
      425.33,
      401.89,
      471.83
